		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID c6e074a2-bcf8-44fe-b339-59be1c2d49c4</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">R-MISSION</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::16:7:18</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 The system shall minimise loss of life from severe weather and tsunami events through timely early warning.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 4e875824-d06a-4012-b44f-7c35b8fc4efe</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">FR-Sensing</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::16:37:56</_modifiedTime>
			<_lastID type="a">6</_lastID>
			<AggregatesList type="e">
				<value>GUID 4557d240-d899-4455-bae8-c417830e5273</value>
				<value>GUID 1455a6d3-df0c-429c-b4c4-c6dabb8ea793</value>
				<value>GUID 128ade4f-2205-4cf9-899e-9abf98c4bdbd</value>
				<value>GUID 192520be-19e8-42b1-b599-ec0c3b1acb94</value>
				<value>GUID 6fbc0341-1578-466c-9e92-06376a88bf38</value>
				<value>GUID 41877608-bdb5-496c-a49d-7a34806a6105</value>
			</AggregatesList>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 4557d240-d899-4455-bae8-c417830e5273</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">FR-01</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::16:35:58</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 The system shall continuously ac-\par%0D
quire satellite imagery and meteoro-\par%0D
logical data at a minimum temporal\par%0D
resolution of 15 minutes over the full\par%0D
coverage area.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 1455a6d3-df0c-429c-b4c4-c6dabb8ea793</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">FR-02</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::16:36:18</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 The system shall acquire airborne\par%0D
sensor measurements (including\par%0D
wind speed, wind direction, atmo-\par%0D
spheric pressure, temperature, and\par%0D
precipitation type) during active\par%0D
weather monitoring missions.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 128ade4f-2205-4cf9-899e-9abf98c4bdbd</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">FR-03</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::16:36:34</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20  The system shall continuously ac-\par%0D
quire seismic activity measurements\par%0D
from underwater sensor nodes at a\par%0D
minimum sampling rate of 100 Hz.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 192520be-19e8-42b1-b599-ec0c3b1acb94</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">FR-04</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::16:37:11</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 The system shall continuously monitor ocean water pressure and flow direction at all active underwater sensor node locations\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 6fbc0341-1578-466c-9e92-06376a88bf38</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">FR-05</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::16:37:37</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 The system shall transmit sensor data from underwater nodes to surface relay buoys via acoustic communication links.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 41877608-bdb5-496c-a49d-7a34806a6105</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">FR-06</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::16:37:56</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20  The system shall relay data from surface buoys to the central processing infrastructure via satellite uplink within 30 seconds of acquisition.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 12f8f14c-3fd5-4c49-88cc-a01283440cf1</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">FR-Fusion</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:8:14</_modifiedTime>
			<_lastID type="a">3</_lastID>
			<AggregatesList type="e">
				<value>GUID 326c1137-cf85-449d-ae2d-52553657ca36</value>
				<value>GUID 0585d556-b264-46d2-898f-61bc2e17127d</value>
				<value>GUID c5a36702-d0b8-42bd-9ec2-18343d359a57</value>
			</AggregatesList>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 326c1137-cf85-449d-ae2d-52553657ca36</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">FR-07</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:7:26</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 The system shall ingest real-time marine monitoring data from the National Data Buoy Center api at intervals not exceeding 10 minutes. \par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 0585d556-b264-46d2-898f-61bc2e17127d</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">FR-08</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:7:54</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 The system shall ingest gridded atmospheric forecast data from the Meteomatics Weather api at intervals not exceeding 60 minutes.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID c5a36702-d0b8-42bd-9ec2-18343d359a57</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">FR-09</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:8:14</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 The system shall fuse data from all active sensor streams and external data providers into a unified environmental state model.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 158fc6cb-90e5-44fd-b20d-cfbb0db40eee</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">FR-WeatherAnalysis</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:11:35</_modifiedTime>
			<_lastID type="a">2</_lastID>
			<AggregatesList type="e">
				<value>GUID ad8a1e01-1e20-431d-97cc-de12692f12a5</value>
				<value>GUID c3d45081-cc97-4ba9-9dd6-42d613b6b0c7</value>
			</AggregatesList>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID ad8a1e01-1e20-431d-97cc-de12692f12a5</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">FR-10</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:11:22</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 The system shall detect, classify, and track storm systems, including their position (latitude, longitude, altitude), diameter, wind speed, direction, and precipitation type.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID c3d45081-cc97-4ba9-9dd6-42d613b6b0c7</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">FR-11</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:11:35</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 The system shall generate real-time storm trajectory predictions with a forecast horizon of not less than 6 hours and update predictions at intervals not exceeding 15 minutes.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 6949f73b-9d66-4bf1-a016-1740f88bd9e8</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">FR-TsunamiAnalysis</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:16:50</_modifiedTime>
			<_lastID type="a">3</_lastID>
			<AggregatesList type="e">
				<value>GUID 12316557-8de9-47d2-95cc-42ba6e86563a</value>
				<value>GUID c6639b6b-4151-4bef-95d1-691705217091</value>
				<value>GUID 95f1f32a-ce60-499c-ab07-8a878ef593b6</value>
			</AggregatesList>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 12316557-8de9-47d2-95cc-42ba6e86563a</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">FR-12</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:15:38</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 The system shall detect seismic events with a magnitude of 6.5 or greater on the Richter scale occurring within the monitored oceanic region.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID c6639b6b-4151-4bef-95d1-691705217091</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">FR-13</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:15:58</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20  The system shall analyse pressure sensor and flow direction data to identify oceanographic anomalies consistent with tsunami generation following a qualifying seismic event.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 95f1f32a-ce60-499c-ab07-8a878ef593b6</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">FR-14</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:16:50</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 The system shall generate a tsunami risk assessment (estimated wave height, propagation direction, coastal arrival time, and confidence level) within 60 seconds of detecting a qualifying seismic event.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 1c09b62d-b0b5-4b5c-b9d4-ac9ced11f108</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">FR-RiskAssessment</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:10:43</_modifiedTime>
			<_lastID type="a">1</_lastID>
			<AggregatesList type="e">
				<value>GUID 00a315f8-888c-4d68-bcc4-65c5e930561b</value>
			</AggregatesList>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 00a315f8-888c-4d68-bcc4-65c5e930561b</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">FR-15</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:10:43</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 The system shall evaluate sensor data against predefined threat thresholds for seismic magnitude, storm intensity, water pressure deviation, and wind speed to trigger automated alert generation.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 5d71fe91-e325-4e58-997e-1d20fc016622</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">FR-AlertDissemination</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:14:22</_modifiedTime>
			<_lastID type="a">3</_lastID>
			<AggregatesList type="e">
				<value>GUID 2191a699-b416-40df-8991-f8a502bb9a42</value>
				<value>GUID eebec7aa-0e4e-4020-ae07-cf5311f679cb</value>
				<value>GUID f32de222-e95b-4947-9dad-f2bd68ec3d94</value>
			</AggregatesList>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 2191a699-b416-40df-8991-f8a502bb9a42</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">FR-16</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:12:59</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20  The system shall generate a structured threat alert containing: threat type, severity classification, affected geographic area, estimated time of impact, confidence level, and recommended public action.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID eebec7aa-0e4e-4020-ae07-cf5311f679cb</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">FR-17</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:13:47</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 The system shall disseminate confirmed threat alerts via sms, mobile push notification, government agency api, and emergency broadcast channels simultaneously.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID f32de222-e95b-4947-9dad-f2bd68ec3d94</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">FR-18</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:14:22</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 The system shall support alert dissemination in a minimum of five languages, configurable per geographic deployment region.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 1f2fa632-f328-440a-b5e3-c86fe9b329c6</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">FR-Operations</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:20:15</_modifiedTime>
			<_lastID type="a">6</_lastID>
			<AggregatesList type="e">
				<value>GUID 9def20b1-9d66-40cb-97d6-aa2eb5e901dd</value>
				<value>GUID dc7a1fc4-f941-45fa-a3e2-f3caa92e84ed</value>
				<value>GUID 337897c9-98c4-4aed-aac4-426c022de797</value>
				<value>GUID 5ceff4ce-1c55-44eb-b02a-ab3cc45834d2</value>
				<value>GUID 47de5e5f-6ac8-487b-b892-074e3b0635c1</value>
				<value>GUID 28b7feaf-df92-4f55-81a6-4e3bdcf940b2</value>
			</AggregatesList>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 9def20b1-9d66-40cb-97d6-aa2eb5e901dd</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">FR-19</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:18:8</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 The system shall provide a real-time operator monitoring dashboard displaying sensor network health, active data streams, current threat assessments, and alert dissemination status.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID dc7a1fc4-f941-45fa-a3e2-f3caa92e84ed</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">FR-20</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:18:28</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 The system shall allow authorised operators to manually override automated alert decisions, with all override actions logged with a timestamp, operator identifier, and justification.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 337897c9-98c4-4aed-aac4-426c022de797</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">FR-21</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:18:48</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 The system shall archive all raw sensor data, processed environmental state models, threat assessments, and alert records with a retention period of not less than 10 years.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 5ceff4ce-1c55-44eb-b02a-ab3cc45834d2</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">FR-22</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:19:9</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 The system shall provide authenticated, structured access to archived data for research users via a dedicated data portal api.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 47de5e5f-6ac8-487b-b892-074e3b0635c1</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">FR-23</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:19:26</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 The system shall perform continuous self-diagnostics on all sensor nodes, communication links, and processing modules, and generate maintenance alerts upon detection of component degradation or failure.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 28b7feaf-df92-4f55-81a6-4e3bdcf940b2</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">FR-24</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:20:15</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 The system shall automatically activate redundant sensor nodes and communication pathways upon detection of primary component failure, without interruption to monitoring or alert functions.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 525bb5fe-955c-4763-a0e7-b6f7c48d34a7</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">NFR-Performance</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:24:38</_modifiedTime>
			<_lastID type="a">3</_lastID>
			<AggregatesList type="e">
				<value>GUID 9279e657-a810-4779-8bf2-9cdfe1948e50</value>
				<value>GUID 12a95d70-07e7-4907-84aa-7420afe7fe4b</value>
				<value>GUID f02c3278-ca8d-4e1a-bc14-6ff1038a3e73</value>
			</AggregatesList>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 9279e657-a810-4779-8bf2-9cdfe1948e50</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">NFR-01</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:23:59</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 The end-to-end latency from sensor data acquisition to threat alert generation shall not exceed 60 seconds under nominal operating conditions.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 12a95d70-07e7-4907-84aa-7420afe7fe4b</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">NFR-02</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:24:18</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 The end-to-end latency from threat alert generation to confirmed public dissemination via all active channels shall not exceed 90 seconds.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID f02c3278-ca8d-4e1a-bc14-6ff1038a3e73</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">NFR-11</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:24:38</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 The system shall process a sustained inbound data rate of no less than 500 MB per minute across all active sensor streams without degradation of threat assessment latency.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID adfc9b08-8241-4980-ab59-258acda7d962</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">NFR-Availability</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:43:16</_modifiedTime>
			<_lastID type="a">2</_lastID>
			<AggregatesList type="e">
				<value>GUID ee3cc590-b72c-4d62-a2f1-20e12fca7b96</value>
				<value>GUID 28fcbd64-a94f-4d80-b282-344727fe7ae6</value>
			</AggregatesList>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID ee3cc590-b72c-4d62-a2f1-20e12fca7b96</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">NFR-03</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:43:16</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 The system shall maintain an operational availability of no less than 99.5\\%25, measured on a rolling 12-month basis across all monitored regions. \par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 28fcbd64-a94f-4d80-b282-344727fe7ae6</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">NFR-04</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:43:1</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 The mean time to recover from a detected subsystem failure shall not exceed 120 seconds for Critical-priority subsystems.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID e2259fdd-c099-4c8c-83e8-036190b0f9e6</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">NFR-Accuracy</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:29:42</_modifiedTime>
			<_lastID type="a">4</_lastID>
			<AggregatesList type="e">
				<value>GUID fcf5a9e0-491c-4315-8bfa-50534d394ac9</value>
				<value>GUID a38f4c3d-15c9-46f9-80cc-6a45be5830b5</value>
				<value>GUID 17acc41c-fb9b-4110-a2b3-11d487f49e97</value>
				<value>GUID 98ed745f-ef61-46a5-833f-aaed8b2f4c5e</value>
			</AggregatesList>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID fcf5a9e0-491c-4315-8bfa-50534d394ac9</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">NFR-05</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:27:15</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 The false-positive alert rate for confirmed threat events shall not exceed 5%25 of total alerts issued over any 90-day operational period.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID a38f4c3d-15c9-46f9-80cc-6a45be5830b5</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">NFR-06</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:27:28</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 Storm trajectory prediction accuracy shall be no less than 85\\%25 when evaluated against verified historical event datasets over a 6-hour forecast horizon.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 17acc41c-fb9b-4110-a2b3-11d487f49e97</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">NFR-07</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:28:36</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">Tsunami wave arrival time predictions shall be accurate to within +=5 minutes at coastal monitoring stations, validated against historical tsunami event records.</_body>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 98ed745f-ef61-46a5-833f-aaed8b2f4c5e</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">NFR-15</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:29:42</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 Archived sensor data and event records shall be stored with a data integrity guarantee of no greater than 0.1%25 data loss per operational year.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 2ee818b5-ca99-46fd-b376-d73aec4ebf37</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">NFR-Resilience</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:45:46</_modifiedTime>
			<_lastID type="a">3</_lastID>
			<AggregatesList type="e">
				<value>GUID ded06f80-bf1d-4d19-86b0-fd0503394815</value>
				<value>GUID 98f25604-7b2d-427b-b200-223e87c2fa62</value>
				<value>GUID 4f548696-3295-4b2d-90bd-2c242e8b1cac</value>
			</AggregatesList>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID ded06f80-bf1d-4d19-86b0-fd0503394815</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">NFR-08</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:45:9</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 The system shall sustain full operational capability with up to 20%25 of underwater sensor nodes simultaneously offline, through data interpolation and redundant node activation.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 98f25604-7b2d-427b-b200-223e87c2fa62</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">NFR-12</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:45:25</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 The system architecture shall support the addition of new sensor node types and external data provider interfaces without requiring modifications to the core data fusion engine.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 4f548696-3295-4b2d-90bd-2c242e8b1cac</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">NFR-18</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:45:46</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 The system shall operate within the power budget constraints of remote surface buoys, with sensor node transmission cycles designed to sustain a minimum 12-month battery life between maintenance visits. \par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 6a4613d2-bc20-49d6-a42e-da23aaa729e1</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">NFR-Security</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:35:54</_modifiedTime>
			<_lastID type="a">4</_lastID>
			<AggregatesList type="e">
				<value>GUID bb140691-0456-464c-9315-9aa333a1b853</value>
				<value>GUID 51217260-3ffd-4577-91aa-6eed91d21e6e</value>
				<value>GUID 156e361d-4f0a-4b85-91b7-5a7886c3921b</value>
				<value>GUID b99284bc-9f2f-4aff-968f-b38c68825943</value>
			</AggregatesList>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID bb140691-0456-464c-9315-9aa333a1b853</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">NFR-09</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:33:27</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 All inter-subsystem and external data communications shall be encrypted using a minimum of AES-256 for data at rest and TLS 1.3 for data in transit.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 51217260-3ffd-4577-91aa-6eed91d21e6e</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">NFR-10</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:33:51</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 The operator interface shall be accessible only to authenticated and authorised personnel, with role-based access control enforced at the application layer.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 156e361d-4f0a-4b85-91b7-5a7886c3921b</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">NFR-13</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:35:17</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 All public-facing alert messages shall conform to the Common Alerting Protocol (CAP) v1.2 international standard.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID b99284bc-9f2f-4aff-968f-b38c68825943</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">NFR-14</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:35:54</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 The system shall comply with applicable ITU radio frequency regulations, noaa data sharing agreements, and national civil protection legislation in all deployment regions.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 3365ece1-f9d8-4e4b-ac86-52e59630ea18</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">NFR-Usability</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:40:36</_modifiedTime>
			<_lastID type="a">2</_lastID>
			<AggregatesList type="e">
				<value>GUID 4964f762-b722-465d-a275-bfdd42101da3</value>
				<value>GUID 637bfde6-5a35-42df-900e-532534d3ec63</value>
			</AggregatesList>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 4964f762-b722-465d-a275-bfdd42101da3</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">NFR-16</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:37:1</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 The operator monitoring dashboard shall render real-time updates at a minimum refresh rate of once per second under nominal system load.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
		</IRequirement>
		<IRequirement type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 637bfde6-5a35-42df-900e-532534d3ec63</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">NFR-17</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">5.19.2026::17:40:36</_modifiedTime>
			<_body type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 Public alert messages shall be formulated at a maximum reading level of B1 (CEFR) in all supported languages to ensure comprehension across diverse populations.\par%0D
}%0D
</_body>
